{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-13","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, and the number after the unit be prime, the greatest will not be measured by any except those which have a place among the proportional numbers.","book":9,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","contentId":"euclid-9-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f46f0354d9e0d7491706f4f3f57565463e805125dedf0ce6985ea13476e5282d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-13.statement","euclid-9-13.construction.1","euclid-9-13.proof.1","euclid-9-13.proof.2","euclid-9-13.proof.3","euclid-9-13.proof.4","euclid-9-13.proof.5","euclid-9-13.proof.6","euclid-9-13.proof.7","euclid-9-13.proof.8","euclid-9-13.proof.9","euclid-9-13.proof.10","euclid-9-13.proof.11","euclid-9-13.proof.12","euclid-9-13.proof.13","euclid-9-13.proof.14","euclid-9-13.proof.15","euclid-9-13.proof.16","euclid-9-13.proof.17","euclid-9-13.proof.18","euclid-9-13.proof.19","euclid-9-13.proof.20","euclid-9-13.proof.21","euclid-9-13.proof.22","euclid-9-13.proof.23","euclid-9-13.proof.24","euclid-9-13.proof.25","euclid-9-13.construction.2","euclid-9-13.proof.26","euclid-9-13.proof.27","euclid-9-13.proof.28","euclid-9-13.proof.29","euclid-9-13.proof.30","euclid-9-13.construction.3","euclid-9-13.proof.31","euclid-9-13.proof.32","euclid-9-13.proof.33","euclid-9-13.proof.34","euclid-9-13.proof.35","euclid-9-13.conclusion","euclid-9-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe3c83810538ee71cdcc6656ca2c20457f7d76aa82d03d88ad730760812d8da9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, and the number after the unit be prime, the greatest will not be measured by any except those which have a place among the proportional numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从单位开始的连比例个数字,单位之后的数字是质数,那么除成比例个数字中的位置之外,任何数字都不会是最大的数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16817747b14a0b2af8f9dc2aa484cbb8716f671652a24ac6e2a0629741e86ccb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be as many numbers as we please, A, B, C, D, beginning from an unit and in continued proportion, and let A, the number after the unit, be prime; I say that D, the greatest of them, will not be measured by any other number except A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B,C,D,从单位开始,连比例开始,A,单位之后的数字最好;我说,D,其中最大的数字,除A,B,C之外,将不以任何其他数字来整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1475ba2c5e7cf25ef47cd8e1b8d329ec98aa19f590b7dc2ac969e131e6a9e757","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be measured by E, and let E not be the same with any of the numbers A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,用E来整除,而E则与A、B、C等数字中的任何数字不同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"50074764d14c8a3d7c85a9c22ce5eed12e394123a3503b5f4bc094b0de9b99cb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then manifest that E is not prime."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"很明显,E不是最优秀的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f564013129a3b9b6d233d7310032bd289d18906e6aadda676c1673a8a0be9e28","citations":["euclid-9-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if E is prime and measures D, it will also measure A [[IX. 12](/principles/euclid-9-12)], which is prime, though it is not the same with it: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果E是质数,整除 D, 也将会整除 A, 虽然这与质数不同, [[IX. 12](/principles/euclid-9-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d25605ec7c627ac023c60601350d257a87393b60878aeeb9bd6df8bf925f0b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E is not prime."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以E不是最顶尖的"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8dc8a724b450ffc4dd1538cbf8bb8b9f50e14a952a9ba68da21d66e72cb2dcb5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it is composite."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它是综合的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43b4195d1485e110b49e0868c882a615abe5374d211c108703ffd0313ceef38b","citations":["euclid-7-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But any composite number is measured by some prime number; [[VII. 31](/principles/euclid-7-31)] therefore E is measured by some prime number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,任何合数个都用大约素数个整除;因此,E用大约素数个整除。 [[VII. 31](/principles/euclid-7-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37c50311229fb138e4fc1b0badcebcb82e5ec7b959b4e09c57ed6b47a0e020ed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it will not be measured by any other prime except A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,除了A之外,它不会用任何其他的质数来整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7831b182bc8509b95709b5eb0ffbd9e6d97bcc31d3285d6a31039e67845676a8","citations":["euclid-9-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if E is measured by another, and E measures D, that other will also measure D; so that it will also measure A [[IX. 12](/principles/euclid-9-12)], which is prime, though it is not the same with it: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果用另一个来整除E, E, 整除, D, 另一颗也整除, D; 那样它也会是整除, A, 虽然它不同, 但它是不可能的。 [[IX. 12](/principles/euclid-9-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0a0ae2e931788fa23eda5c766c6ba50636c41fe2b1537accba85e0624a25985","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A measures E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A 整除 E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39ead39ce2a7eb01a8c09db2a4f94d91c02c7a662977cfa3dcc8722492ebf059","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since E measures D, let it measure it according to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有自E9月30日以来F说整除"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a87443e77ac8ffc5b8b7baa41d2e4837c459566d0d9db16dcde602523176f416","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that F is not the same with any of the numbers A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,F与A、B、C的数字不一样。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26b1ceae1d1be1c02d98c483cf8f8f6ab579f1f8b6138520bc02464ed2da3a82","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if F is the same with one of the numbers A, B, C, and measures D according to E, therefore one of the numbers A, B, C also measures D according to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E名中,如果F与A、B、C和整除 D相同,那么,A、B、C与E名中整除 D相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"940204de0f63a00c0803cf41e9ee7563bec4f1358040394457823c8e5e07673f","citations":["euclid-9-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But one of the numbers A, B, C measures D according to some one of the numbers A, B, C; [[IX. 11](/principles/euclid-9-11)] therefore E is also the same with one of the numbers A, B, C: which is contrary to the hypothesis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据A、B、C、整除、D等数字中的某些数字,其中1个数字是A、B、C;因此,E数字中1个数字与A、B、C和C是相同的,这与假设相反。 [[IX. 11](/principles/euclid-9-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1e079045f12d9a0ef066891277867478d6e4b545e0e8c820dbaf701057193ca8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore F is not the same as any one of the numbers A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,F项与A、B、C项数字中的任何一项不同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"335ba0f8e980b823a7116c62a483a1e558ebb9b7229a9ba60901d4af5c517868","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that F is measured by A, by proving again that F is not prime."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们也可以证明F是A,再次证明F不是最主要。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f3f1fea7ec47a7cb138898512366b9b5cd94a8beb6d2513a20b943b7ca99365","citations":["euclid-9-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if it is, and measures D, it will also measure A [[IX. 12](/principles/euclid-9-12)], which is prime, though it is not the same with it: which is impossible; therefore F is not prime."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果是,整除 D, 也将是整除 A, 虽然是最重要的, 但与它不同:不可能, 因此F不是最首要的。 [[IX. 12](/principles/euclid-9-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8dc8a724b450ffc4dd1538cbf8bb8b9f50e14a952a9ba68da21d66e72cb2dcb5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it is composite."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它是综合的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dda9f204ff61be690224c375885c18498206e8fd9827994fab2cf9664135f56a","citations":["euclid-7-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But any composite number is measured by some prime number; [[VII. 31](/principles/euclid-7-31)] therefore F is measured by some prime number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,任何合数个都用大约素数个整除;因此,F用大约素数个整除。 [[VII. 31](/principles/euclid-7-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37c50311229fb138e4fc1b0badcebcb82e5ec7b959b4e09c57ed6b47a0e020ed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it will not be measured by any other prime except A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,除了A之外,它不会用任何其他的质数来整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74ff37059a8e752554c58c162c9a24bc7f48d4e3e6750dd0e707126f8264176e","citations":["euclid-9-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if any other prime number measures F, and F measures D, that other will also measure D; so that it will also measure A [[IX. 12](/principles/euclid-9-12)], which is prime, though it is not the same with it: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其它素数 整除 F,F,F,整除 整除 D, D, 也整除 D; 如此一来,整除 A, 虽然不是一样, 但也是不可能的。 [[IX. 12](/principles/euclid-9-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6e67fd65dd77eec469e1541dfd27e4b1a40daacff2c832716a1597551a1ba34","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A measures F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A 整除 F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"121ac4a1765925099e1585456330d2048343135d60be08a263803e97539a9401","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since E measures D according to F, therefore E by multiplying F has made D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E 整除 D F 乘以F E D 已经是D了"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"40d1fe0c0d09bb6c5e8223f131c29530c0663822210bde1c848c896025d19e1e","citations":["euclid-9-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, A has also by multiplying C made D; [[IX. 11](/principles/euclid-9-11)] therefore the product of A, C is equal to the product of E, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,还有A乘以C乘以D;因此,A、C的产品等于E、F的产品。 [[IX. 11](/principles/euclid-9-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24f4cba90bb22777994af7701e13b48175c91a592bb32f80a70209293d619e35","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as A is to E, so is F to C. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比E的比例相当于F比C；A 与 E 之比等于 F 与 C 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a3af6d20d3f2a4f8c424937f3623b7edff2d8262b42d591b0f09c67de7fb0901","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A measures E; therefore F also measures C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A 整除 E,因此F 也是整除 C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":27,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6d065052961c28e6ca4d07ef38db93d2596764c1918d479c32e2ecf2fa232cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it measure it according to G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G,整除机"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35b1591cc1a1df2893945d1ddfa920a18eb0d81621b9990b9e66aaedbd266e4e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly, then, we can prove that G is not the same with any of the numbers A, B, and that it is measured by A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,G与A中的任何人不同,而以A整除。（相关点与线段：B）"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6557d56fdc3ddc2546500d66ad539305318fefcf0d9bc3fb4f9a5a47eb01d5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since F measures C according to G therefore F by multiplying G has made C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"F 整除 C G 乘以G F C C C C C G"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab64f1326ad0c291bb8ce4586af1231b3d5d4b1f4a516bed0f812ebbd743601d","citations":["euclid-9-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, A has also by multiplying B made C; [[IX. 11](/principles/euclid-9-11)] therefore the product of A, B is equal to the product of F, G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,还有A乘以B乘以C;因此,A、B的产品等于F、G的产品。 [[IX. 11](/principles/euclid-9-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.29","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":31,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 29","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e22a2c93272328ba73a7c393cc5c649729007bb0f2e5b0c2d56150b51dd965b7","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as A is to F, so is G to B. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比F的比例相当于G比B；A 与 F 之比等于 G 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.30","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":32,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 30","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a20445618f9b83da7c9cc724b007c65424befb7a09ed73d2ecb00b3858379201","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A measures F; therefore G also measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A 整除 F,因此G 也是整除 B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":33,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c68bf86d60a156587149a968e980685824cf42ba0b7d0b25fddaafad86bde534","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it measure it according to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"H,整除机"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.31","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":34,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 31","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d68cce4f682596949fc0a358a6e870bed4b9cdf6ecf7275b04a02579061f7f0b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly then we can prove that H is not the same with A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明A的H不相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.32","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":35,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 32","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab262dbe891471e4dd1a917a327acd37b2104a10b7cacf754233200ecedc8fa2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since G measures B according to H, therefore G by multiplying H has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G 整除 B H 乘以H G B 已经是B了"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.33","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":36,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 33","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30c0fe15f41de7f761d59cb1943b741baae559b392eb629bdead47bc5d2cb692","citations":["euclid-9-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But further A has also by multiplying itself made B; [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)] therefore the product of H, G is equal to the square on A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但通过乘以本身,又有A种,即B种;因此H,G种产品等于A种。 [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.34","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":37,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 34","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5cc5940a22b9909f031a03d015e873b2c16b90f44ee22da025bb08225eca6ab","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as H is to A, so is A to G. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,H对A的比等于A对G的比；H 与 A 之比等于 A 与 G 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.proof.35","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":38,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 35","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4d420e84d6160f7887088083d289e509818bdfda64224067943710a9e94a04b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A measures G;lt therefore H also measures A, which is prime, though it is not the same with it: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A 整除 G;因此,H 也是整除 A,尽管与它不同,但这是最关键的:这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":39,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ae978c8ca82d2853f41ccd29ba90ca76e448874ff553481f39cffb24de85e7e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D the greatest will not be measured by any other number except A, B, C. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,除A、B、C、Q、E、D外,其他数字将无法计算最大者为D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-13.source","contentId":"euclid-9-13","revisionId":"euclid-9-13@raw-f46f0354d9e0d749","order":40,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4153f18b6c01b5197765b4467d119f5d7cebb6610bb39a4cbf36c992425f511b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-13:euclid-9-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-13.proof.3","euclid-9-13.proof.8","euclid-9-13.proof.16","euclid-9-13.proof.20"],"targ